## Security — Mac dev (keep as-is)

```bash
NODE_ENV=development
AUTH_COOKIE_SAMESITE=strict
AUTH_COOKIE_SECURE=false
PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
DEV_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:40000

